@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
 BorderColor #344054
 FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
 BorderColor #667085
 FontColor #101828
 BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
title Behavior - Style supported portal mount
actor "Application user" as actor
box "Frontend - Consumer browser application" #E0F2FE
participant "useFluentProvider_unstable" as provider
participant "useFluentProviderThemeStyleTag" as tag
participant "useFluentProviderContextValues_unstable" as context
participant "usePortalMountNode" as portal
end box
actor -> portal : Mount portal under themed provider [L2-009]
portal -> context : Read theme class, dir, targetDocument
context --> portal : Effective provider values
portal -> portal : Create supported mount node and apply attributes
portal --> actor : Portal content in target document
note over portal : Explicit custom mount nodes require their documented setup
@enduml
